      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Pixel Combination Lock</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"card\">\n  <h1>Pixel Combination Lock</h1>\n  <p class=\"subtitle\">Set the dials and press Open.</p>\n\n  <section class=\"dials\" aria-label=\"Combination dials\">\n    <div class=\"dial-group\">\n      <button class=\"dial-btn\" id=\"up-0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Increase first dial\">▲</button>\n      <div class=\"digit\" id=\"digit-0\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"First dial value\">0</div>\n      <button class=\"dial-btn\" id=\"down-0\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Decrease first dial\">▼</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dial-group\">\n      <button class=\"dial-btn\" id=\"up-1\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Increase second dial\">▲</button>\n      <div class=\"digit\" id=\"digit-1\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"Second dial value\">0</div>\n      <button class=\"dial-btn\" id=\"down-1\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Decrease second dial\">▼</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dial-group\">\n      <button class=\"dial-btn\" id=\"up-2\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Increase third dial\">▲</button>\n      <div class=\"digit\" id=\"digit-2\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"Third dial value\">0</div>\n      <button class=\"dial-btn\" id=\"down-2\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Decrease third dial\">▼</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <button class=\"open-btn\" id=\"open-btn\" type=\"button\">Open</button>\n\n  <p class=\"status\" id=\"status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n\n  <p class=\"counter\">Failed attempts: <span id=\"fail-count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</span></p>\n\n  <p class=\"unlocked\" id=\"unlocked\" hidden>🔓 Unlocked! The lock is open.</p>\n</main>\n<script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Markup with three dials, Open button, status, failed-attempt counter, and hidden unlocked message."
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1b1e2b;\n  --card: #2a2f45;\n  --accent: #f5c542;\n  --accent-dark: #c79a1d;\n  --text: #f4f4f8;\n  --muted: #a0a4b8;\n  --success: #6ee7a8;\n  --danger: #ff6b6b;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\n[hidden] {\n  display: none !important;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 20px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 75%),\n                    linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 75%);\n  background-size: 16px 16px;\n  background-position: 0 0, 8px 8px;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\n.card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 28px 24px;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--bg), 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.subtitle {\n  margin: 0 0 24px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 1rem;\n}\n\n.dials {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.dial-group {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex: 1 1 80px;\n  max-width: 100px;\n}\n\n.dial-btn {\n  width: 100%;\n  min-height: 44px;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: var(--bg);\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent-dark);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.05s;\n}\n\n.dial-btn:hover {\n  background: #ffd75e;\n}\n\n.dial-btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.dial-btn:active {\n  background: var(--accent-dark);\n  transform: translateY(2px);\n}\n\n.digit {\n  width: 100%;\n  min-height: 64px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 2.25rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--bg);\n  background: var(--text);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent-dark);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\n.open-btn {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  min-height: 52px;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--bg);\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent-dark);\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.05s;\n}\n\n.open-btn:hover {\n  background: #ffd75e;\n}\n\n.open-btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.open-btn:active {\n  background: var(--accent-dark);\n  transform: translateY(2px);\n}\n\n.status {\n  min-height: 1.5em;\n  margin: 16px 0 8px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.status.error {\n  color: var(--danger);\n}\n\n.status.success {\n  color: var(--success);\n}\n\n.counter {\n  margin: 8px 0 0;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 1rem;\n}\n\n.counter span {\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.unlocked {\n  margin: 16px 0 0;\n  padding: 12px;\n  background: rgba(110, 231, 168, 0.15);\n  border: 2px solid var(--success);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  color: var(--success);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 20px 16px;\n  }\n  .dials {\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .digit {\n    font-size: 1.75rem;\n    min-height: 56px;\n  }\n}\n",
      "description": "Pixel-themed responsive styling with palette, hover/focus/pressed states, and [hidden] rule."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  var TARGET = [3, 7, 2];\n  var dials = [0, 0, 0];\n  var fails = 0;\n  var unlocked = false;\n\n  var digitEls = [\n    document.getElementById('digit-0'),\n    document.getElementById('digit-1'),\n    document.getElementById('digit-2')\n  ];\n  var statusEl = document.getElementById('status');\n  var failCountEl = document.getElementById('fail-count');\n  var unlockedEl = document.getElementById('unlocked');\n  var openBtn = document.getElementById('open-btn');\n\n  function render() {\n    for (var i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n      digitEls[i].textContent = String(dials[i]);\n    }\n    failCountEl.textContent = String(fails);\n  }\n\n  function changeDial(index, delta) {\n    if (unlocked) return;\n    dials[index] = (dials[index] + delta + 10) % 10;\n    render();\n    statusEl.textContent = '';\n    statusEl.className = 'status';\n  }\n\n  function attemptOpen() {\n    if (unlocked) return;\n    var match = dials[0] === TARGET[0] && dials[1] === TARGET[1] && dials[2] === TARGET[2];\n    if (match) {\n      unlocked = true;\n      statusEl.textContent = 'Correct combination!';\n      statusEl.className = 'status success';\n      unlockedEl.hidden = false;\n      openBtn.disabled = true;\n    } else {\n      fails += 1;\n      statusEl.textContent = 'Wrong combination. Try again.';\n      statusEl.className = 'status error';\n      render();\n    }\n  }\n\n  for (var i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n    (function (index) {\n      document.getElementById('up-' + index).addEventListener('click', function () {\n        changeDial(index, 1);\n      });\n      document.getElementById('down-' + index).addEventListener('click', function () {\n        changeDial(index, -1);\n      });\n    })(i);\n  }\n\n  openBtn.addEventListener('click', attemptOpen);\n\n  render();\n})();\n",
      "description": "Dial wrap-around logic, Open validation for 3-7-2, failed-attempt counter, and unlock state."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Combination Lock\n\nA self-contained, offline browser app: a pixel-art styled three-dial combination lock. Each dial runs 0–9 with wrapping up/down buttons. Press **Open** to try the combination **3-7-2**. Wrong attempts are counted.\n\n## Run\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No build step, server, network requests, or external assets are required.\n\n## Features\n\n- Three dials (0–9) with wrap-around up/down buttons.\n- Open button validates the combination 3-7-2.\n- Failed-attempt counter.\n- Keyboard-accessible labeled buttons with visible hover, focus, and pressed states.\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and controls.\n- `styles.css` — pixel theme, layout, and states.\n- `script.js` — dial state, wrap-around logic, and open validation.\n",
      "description": "Documentation describing the app, features, and how to run it."
    }
  ]
}